   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "risk: a build-up of aggregates toward the slot end\nscheduled 3 per slot + catch-alls + duplicates → the\nverification and forwarding load piles up exactly where\nthe next block is being built and propagated\n(today's devnet already shows late votes, not late aggregates)",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "risk: a build-up of aggregates toward the slot end\nscheduled 3 per slot + catch-alls + duplicates → the\nverification and forwarding load piles up exactly where\nthe next block is being built and propagated\n(today's devnet already shows late votes, not late aggregates)",
